        "slc_eac4e57abbde8f2dab47a9a72ab00b8194e4824964d35ac42f653d0c4a6b8d26"
      ],
      "text": "ralph.sh accepts an optional max_iterations argument and a --tool flag selecting amp (the default) or claude; the default iteration count is 10."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_54a1a0f5098ee00a2e3990252799d74d4bb67491bccd573b68936b6dec47101c",
